.TH WORDCOUNT 1
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words, and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wordCount
.I file lines words chars
.SH DESCRIPTION
The wordCount function reads the contents of a file and counts
the number of lines, words, and characters. The results are
stored through the provided pointer arguments.
